{"id": "UgwlmW_wn-dXSfxk-_14AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 5, "text": "\"You are reading this because our timelines crossed for a fraction of a second. By the time you think of a reply, the version of you that first read these words will already be in the past. Are you truly the one replying, or just an echo?\nSent with a heavy, haunting embrace from —a land that knows exactly how it feels to watch time steal everything away.\"", "published": "2026-10-08T12:30:34", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugxq0mzTEGfgXh7o6nV4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "I never imagined that a blend of distinctive Egyptian music and jazz could be this beautiful.", "published": "2026-10-02T04:08:07", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
